---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
---

<Layout title="About" description={`About ${site.brand.name}: leadership, delivery philosophy, and how I work.`}>
  <div class="surface relative mb-10 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-8">
    <img
      src="/images/library/it-infrastructure/a6ac98b7add388a11e26f63afd33e783.jpg"
      alt=""
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-18"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <div class="relative flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <img
          src={site.assets.logo}
          alt={`${site.brand.companyName} logo`}
          class="h-14 w-auto rounded-2xl bg-white/50 p-3 shadow-sm backdrop-blur dark:bg-white/5"
          loading="eager"
        />
        <div>
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">{site.brand.companyName}</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            {site.brand.name} • {site.brand.role}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="animate-shimmer inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-glow hover:bg-brand-700"
      >
        Contact
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-start">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">About</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        I operate at the intersection of product, engineering, and leadership. My work is to reduce risk, increase
        delivery speed, and build systems that create durable business value.
      </p>

      <div class="surface mt-6 rounded-3xl p-6">
        <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Focus areas</div>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">
          <li class="flex gap-2">
            <span class="mt-1 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
            Strategy → roadmap → execution with measurable outcomes
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-2">
            <span class="mt-1 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
            Architecture reviews and modernization without breaking the business
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-2">
            <span class="mt-1 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
            Delivery systems: quality gates, CI/CD, observability, incident readiness
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-2">
            <span class="mt-1 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
            Leadership: hiring, mentoring, operating rhythm, stakeholder alignment
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <div class="surface rounded-3xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">How I work</h2>
        <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="surface rounded-2xl p-4">
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1) Clarify outcomes</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
              Define success metrics, constraints, and timeline. Align stakeholders early.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="surface rounded-2xl p-4">
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2) Reduce risk fast</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
              Prototype, validate architecture, and identify the critical unknowns.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="surface rounded-2xl p-4">
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3) Ship in tight loops</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
              Weekly milestones, visible progress, and clean handoffs.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="surface rounded-2xl p-4">
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4) Build durability</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
              Testing, observability, and operational readiness so growth doesn’t break the product.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/70 p-5">
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Want a tailored plan?</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
            Send your context and goals. I’ll respond with a plan, timeline, and trade-offs.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-glow hover:bg-brand-700"
          >
            Contact
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
